      "scope": "capture endpoint and identity per operation; retain reviewed identity until independently accepted same-rail evidence; version number alone grants no rights",
      "reason": "Reference Build 1.0.60 is a different generation origin; existing 1.0.13 minimum is backed by the frozen explicit user-reported upstream rejection. No independent same-account catalog-and-inference receipt authorizes replacement identity or a group header. The seven-operation matrix and executable current-identity negative controls preserve the reviewed default."
    },
