      "id": "R6F-GR-03",
      "status": "reviewed_gated_no_wire_delta",
      "scope": "distinguish model and account limits only on sufficient same-rail evidence; unknown 429 stays conservative; no alternate model/account/plane or additional replay",
      "reason": "Both recommended references recognize Build free-usage text and broad model hints. No independent target direct-XAI sample proves that text authorizes model-only admission. Unknown 429 remains account-scoped with reset evidence; the new actual-forwarder negative control verifies a single submission and no relogin/alternate plane."
    }
